          "at": "2026-11-03T15:08:03.738Z",
          "html": "<p>Done:  your wording works, alongside the older one.</p>\n<epic-code title=\"Editor.spell\" language=\"spell\"><pre>editor is an app where:\n\t- its \"file\" menu has actions \"save\" and \"open\" and menus \"examples\", titled \"File\"\n\t- its \"examples\" menu has its examples, each running \"open (an example)\"\n\t- its \"bar\" menu has menus \"file\" and \"edit\"\n\t- its menu bar is \"bar menu\"</pre></epic-code>\n<ul>\n<li><code>its \"file\" menu has actions \"save\" and \"open\"</code> compiles exactly as <code>its \"file menu\" is a menu of \"save\" and \"open\"</code> (J21).</li>\n<li>Sub-menus by their words, <code>has menus \"file\"</code>, after any actions (J23);  a list menu says <code>has its examples, each running ...</code> (J24).</li>\n<li>With no <code>titled</code>, its title is its words, <code>file</code> (J22).</li>\n<li>Spanish:  <code>su menú \"archivo\" tiene acciones \"guardar\" y \"abrir\" y menús \"recientes\"</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
          "commit": "132471f8c"
        }
      ],
